  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See these little ones here? They’re Trubbish, the\nTrash Bag Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006500650020007400680065007300650020006C006900740074006C00650020006F006E0065007300200068006500720065003F00200054006800650079201900720065002000540072007500620062006900730068002C0020007400680065000A00540072006100730068002000420061006700200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They’ve developed a taste for our café’s food\nscraps, so they keep coming back...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Truuub!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540072007500750075006200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m happy they like our food, don’t get me wrong.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut that smell the Trubbish give off isn’t exactly a\ncrowd pleaser. We’re starting to lose customers...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 161
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! Here’s a thought.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680021002000480065007200652019007300200061002000740068006F0075006700680074002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If it’s our food these Trubbish are after, maybe we\ncan use that to our advantage!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve made a nice bag of Tasty Trash using our food\nscraps. Do you think you could use it to lead the<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nTrubbish over to the garbage bins?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It would really help us out if you could lead the\nTrubbish away as soon as you can!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh—I guess there’s a battle zone active right\nnow...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLet’s postpone this business with the Trubbish\nuntil tomorrow, then!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you’re free right now, would you mind leading\nthe Trubbish to the nearby garbage bins?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sure thing!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530075007200650020007400680069006E006700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hold on a sec",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006C00640020006F006E0020006100200073006500630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d do it myself, you understand, but I’m still\nworking my shift...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006400200064006F0020006900740020006D007900730065006C0066002C00200079006F007500200075006E006400650072007300740061006E0064002C0020006200750074002000492019006D0020007300740069006C006C000A0077006F0072006B0069006E00670020006D0079002000730068006900660074002E002E002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks! That’s a big help!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B007300210020005400680061007420190073002000610020006200690067002000680065006C00700021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The Trubbish should follow you as long as you’re\nholding this.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065002000540072007500620062006900730068002000730068006F0075006C006400200066006F006C006C006F007700200079006F00750020006100730020006C006F006E006700200061007300200079006F0075201900720065000A0068006F006C00640069006E006700200074006800690073002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Make sure you walk slowly so the Trubbish don’t\nlose you!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006B00650020007300750072006500200079006F0075002000770061006C006B00200073006C006F0077006C007900200073006F002000740068006500200054007200750062006200690073006800200064006F006E20190074000A006C006F0073006500200079006F00750021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The garbage bins are down this alleyway.\nGood luck!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500200067006100720062006100670065002000620069006E0073002000610072006500200064006F0077006E0020007400680069007300200061006C006C00650079007700610079002E000A0047006F006F00640020006C00750063006B0021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please drop off the Tasty Trash at the far end of\nthis alleyway!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002000640072006F00700020006F0066006600200074006800650020005400610073007400790020005400720061007300680020006100740020007400680065002000660061007200200065006E00640020006F0066000A007400680069007300200061006C006C006500790077006100790021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You need to lead the Trubbish to the garbage bins\nat the end of the alleyway!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you want to leave the Tasty Trash here?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F00200079006F0075002000770061006E007400200074006F0020006C0065006100760065002000740068006500200054006100730074007900200054007200610073006800200068006500720065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Drop it off",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440072006F00700020006900740020006F006600660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not yet",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007400200079006500740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Truuuuuub!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540072007500750075007500750075006200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The Trubbish are wolfing down the Tasty Trash...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065002000540072007500620062006900730068002000610072006500200077006F006C00660069006E006700200064006F0077006E0020007400680065002000540061007300740079002000540072006100730068002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks so much for dropping off our trash!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B007300200073006F0020006D00750063006800200066006F0072002000640072006F007000700069006E00670020006F006600660020006F007500720020007400720061007300680021001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The smell from the Trubbish shouldn’t reach the\ncafé if they stay here.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But, gosh, look at them munching happily away.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750074002C00200067006F00730068002C0020006C006F006F006B0020006100740020007400680065006D0020006D0075006E006300680069006E0067002000680061007000700069006C007900200061007700610079002E001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It makes you think, doesn’t it?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCoexisting with Pokémon doesn’t just mean\nsharing the same space...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I mean, these Trubbish love our food just like\nhumans do, but it wouldn’t work to have them<U+0010><U+0001>븀\neat at our café right next to other customers.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maybe coexisting with Pokémon sometimes\nmeans knowing the right distance to keep.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Looks like you have some\nadmirers! How adorable!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F006F006B00730020006C0069006B006500200079006F00750020006800610076006500200073006F006D0065000A00610064006D00690072006500720073002100200048006F0077002000610064006F007200610062006C006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh? Something\nsmells a bit off...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068003F00200053006F006D0065007400680069006E0067000A0073006D0065006C006C00730020006100200062006900740020006F00660066002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You doing a Falinks impression?\nSeems tough, but hang in there!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200064006F0069006E006700200061002000460061006C0069006E006B007300200069006D007000720065007300730069006F006E003F000A005300650065006D007300200074006F007500670068002C0020006200750074002000680061006E006700200069006E00200074006800650072006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Trubbish, hm? Aren’t those the\nlittle helpers that eat garbage?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540072007500620062006900730068002C00200068006D003F0020004100720065006E20190074002000740068006F007300650020007400680065000A006C006900740074006C0065002000680065006C007000650072007300200074006800610074002000650061007400200067006100720062006100670065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "An outing with a troupe of\nTrubbish, eh? Nice work!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0020006F007500740069006E00670020007700690074006800200061002000740072006F0075007000650020006F0066000A00540072007500620062006900730068002C002000650068003F0020004E00690063006500200077006F0072006B00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
